graph TD
    Client[Web / Mobile / B2B / Marketplace] --> CDN[Azure Front Door<br/>CDN + WAF]
    CDN --> BlobStorage[Azure Blob Storage<br/>Static content]
    CDN --> LoadBalancer[Load Balancer]

    LoadBalancer --> APIGW[API Gateway<br/>ASP.NET Core + YARP]

    subgraph Kubernetes Cluster
        APIGW --> Keycloak[Keycloak<br/>Auth & SSO]

        APIGW --> UserSvc[User Service]
        APIGW --> CartSvc[Cart Service]
        APIGW --> OrderSvc[Order Service]
        APIGW --> ProductSvc[Product Service]
        APIGW --> PaymentSvc[Payment Service]

        UserSvc --> Keycloak

        UserSvc --> UserDB[(User DB)]
        CartSvc --> CartDB[(PostgreSQL)]
        OrderSvc --> OrderDB[(PostgreSQL)]
        ProductSvc --> ProductDB[(PostgreSQL)]

        CartSvc --> Redis[(Redis Cluster<br/>cache + idempotency)]
        OrderSvc --> Kafka{{Kafka<br/>Event Bus}}
        ProductSvc --> Kafka

        Kafka --> WarehouseSvc[Warehouse Service]
        Kafka --> AnalyticsSvc[Analytics Service]
        Kafka --> NotifSvc[Notification Service]
        Kafka --> IntegrationSvc[Integration Service]

        IntegrationSvc --> TaxAPI[Porezna uprava API]
        PaymentSvc --> PaymentGW[Stripe / Adyen]
    end
